---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '@/components/PageHeader.astro';
import Todo from '@/components/Todo.astro';
import { site } from '@/config/site';
import { breadcrumbLd } from '@/lib/schema';

const siteUrl = Astro.site ?? new URL('https://example.com');
const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { name: 'Disclaimer', path: '/disclaimer' },
];
const { owner } = site;
const hasCredentials = owner.credentials.length > 0;
// TODO(owner): update when the disclaimer changes.
const lastUpdated = '26 September 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description={`Important information about the calculators and content on the ${site.brandName} website: estimates only, not tax, legal or financial advice.`}
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbLd(siteUrl, crumbs)]}
>
  <PageHeader
    title="Disclaimer"
    lead="Please read this before relying on anything on this website."
    crumbs={crumbs}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="small muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <h2>Information only, not advice</h2>
      <p>
        The content on this website, including service descriptions, FAQs and checklists, is general information. It is not tax,
        legal or financial advice, and it may not cover your particular situation. Tax law, rates, forms and due dates change often,
        and the Income-tax Act, 2025 replaces the Income-tax Act, 1961 from 1 April 2026, which changes many section numbers and
        terms. Always check the current position on the official portals or with a qualified professional before acting.
      </p>

      <h2>Calculators give estimates</h2>
      <p>
        The calculators on this site give <strong>estimates for information only</strong>. They are based on the rules for the year
        shown on each calculator, and on the figures you enter. They do not take every rule, exception or recent change into account.
        Your actual tax, interest or liability depends on your full facts and the law in force, and may differ from the estimate.
        Don’t file a return or make a payment based only on a calculator result.
      </p>

      <h2>Who provides the services</h2>
      <p>
        {site.brandName} is run by {owner.name}, an individual offering tax filing assistance.
        {hasCredentials
          ? <>Credentials: {owner.credentials.join(', ')}.</>
          : <>{owner.name} does not claim to be a Chartered Accountant, a firm, or to hold any professional registration unless it is stated on the <a href="/about">About page</a>. <Todo label="owner to confirm credentials, then revise this paragraph" /></>}
      </p>
      <p>
        Work is carried out on the basis of the information and documents you provide. You remain responsible for the accuracy and
        completeness of that information, and for reviewing and approving anything filed in your name.
      </p>

      <h2>Challan payments</h2>
      <p>
        Help with challans means <strong>assistance with making payments through official government portals only</strong>, such as
        the income tax portal, the GST portal and Parivahan or state transport portals. Payments are made by you, directly to the
        government. {site.brandName} cannot reduce, waive, cancel or settle any traffic fine, penalty or tax demand, and does not
        represent you before traffic authorities or courts. Please never send challan money to any individual.
      </p>

      {site.services.financing && (
        <>
          <h2>Financing</h2>
          <p>
            Financing-related help is limited to preparing and organising your income and tax documents. {site.brandName} does not
            lend money, and makes no promise or claim about loan approval, interest rates or terms, which are decided only by the
            lender. <Todo label="if acting as a loan DSA / agent, disclose it here and name the lenders" />
          </p>
        </>
      )}

      <h2>No affiliation with the government</h2>
      <p>
        {site.brandName} is an independent service. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or acting on behalf of the Income Tax
        Department, the GST Network, CBIC, the Ministry of Road Transport and Highways or any other government body. Links to official
        portals are provided for convenience.
      </p>

      <h2>No guarantee of outcomes</h2>
      <p>
        Refund timelines, processing of returns and registrations, and responses to notices depend on the government departments
        concerned. No particular outcome, refund amount or timeline can be guaranteed.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>This site links to government and other external websites. Their content and availability are outside {site.brandName}’s control.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, {site.brandName} and {owner.name} are not liable for any loss arising from reliance on the
        general information or calculators on this website. Liability for paid work is limited to what is agreed with you for that work.
      </p>

      <p class="small muted">See also the <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>. <Todo label="owner to review this disclaimer" /></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
